						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '101';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('1.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b0" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A Redevelopment Agency (RDA) (also known as a Community Reinvestment Agency, or CRA) is a tool </span><a rel="noopener" href="https://le.utah.gov/xcode/Title17c/17c.html" target="_blank"><span style="font-weight: 400;">under state law</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> that cities use to turn around neglected or industrial areas to foster investment, improve infrastructure and opportunity where private dollars wouldn&rsquo;t otherwise go.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In Vineyard, we created the RDA in 2009 to help transform the former Geneva Steel Mill site&mdash;a large, contaminated and long-vacant industrial property&mdash;into a thriving, livable, and economically sustainable community.</span></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b1" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b1">Why Does Vineyard Need an RDA?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz102"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '102';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '102';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('2.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b1" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Without an RDA, Geneva would not have been transformed. Period.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The land was contaminated, vacant, and unattractive to investors. The RDA made it possible to:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Clean up environmental hazards</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Build roads, water, and sewer systems</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Support affordable housing and public parks</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Attract major employers and institutions, such as UVU, Huntsman Cancer Institute, and Top Golf</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Unlock billions in long-term investment and tax revenue<br /></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Without redevelopment, communities like Vineyard are left behind.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b2" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b2">How Has the RDA Benefited Vineyard So Far?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz106"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '106';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '106';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('3.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b2" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><strong>Results:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Over 20,000 residents now call Vineyard home (up from ~100 in 1989).</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Thousands of jobs have been created.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Major employers and institutions are now investing:</span>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Huntsman Cancer Institute (with $22M in land donated by Flagborough Corp.)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Utah Valley University Vineyard Campus</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Top Golf, Megaplex Theaters, Bella&rsquo;s Market</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Multifamily housing projects are adding millions in new property tax revenues.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Public infrastructure &ndash; roads, water lines, utilities &ndash; constructed without raising taxes.</span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">All of this was made possible by the RDA. Without it, these investments would never have come.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b3" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b3">What Would Not Have Been Built Today Without the RDA?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz107"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '107';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
