                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('4.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b3" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">ALL</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Development North of Center</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Top Golf and the Megaplex Theater</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Huntsman Cancer Institute</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Public infrastructure for roads, sewer, and utilities</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Parks and community amenities</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">UVU&rsquo;s campus access and education corridor</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These projects required upfront public investment and risk that only an RDA could provide.</span></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b4" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b4">Is the RDA Accountable?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz109"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '109';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '109';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('5.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b4" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Absolutely. Vineyard&rsquo;s RDA has:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Held public meetings and passed all funding through official board votes</span></li>
<li><strong>Commissioned external CPA reviews (K&amp;C CPAs) confirming no fraud or misuse</strong></li>
<li>Acted swiftly to address technical accounting issues raised by the State Auditor</li>
<li>Launched transparency initiatives to rebuild trust and improve communication</li>
<li>No fraud, no mismanagement, no hidden spending</li>
<li>All expenditures aligned with adopted project plans and legally binding contracts</li>
</ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b5" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b5">Is Vineyard&#8217;s RDA Successful?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz110"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '110';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '110';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('6.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8150b5" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Yes, it is one of the most successful redevelopment efforts in the state of Utah.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">From industrial ruin to a thriving, modern city, the RDA has:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Sparked billions in investment</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Created jobs and housing</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Expanded the region&rsquo;s tax base</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Preserved educational funding</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Built a foundation for the next 100 years of Vineyard&rsquo;s growth</span></li>
</ul>
<br />
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The following chart shows the taxable value of land in Vineyard&rsquo;s RDA project area (Phases 3 &amp; 4) compared to:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">A nearby residential area not in the RDA area (The Homesteads)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Agricultural land in residential and commercial zones in nearby American Fork that has remained undeveloped</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">A scenario where the Geneva site had never been redeveloped</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The difference is clear: the area in the RDA increased the tax base more than non-RDA areas, &mdash;making land more valuable, productive, and beneficial for the entire region.</span></p>
<iframe src="https://flo.uri.sh/visualisation/22239420/embed" title="Interactive or visual content" frameborder="0" class="flourish-embed-iframe" style="width: 100%; height: 600px;" scrolling="no" sandbox="allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-scripts allow-downloads allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation"></iframe>
<div style="width: 100%!; margin-top: 4px!important; text-align: right!important;"><a class="flourish-credit" style="text-decoration: none!important;" href="https://public.flourish.studio/visualisation/22239420/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_campaign=visualisation/22239420" target="_top"><img style="width: 105px!important; height: 16px!important; border: none!important; margin: 0!important;" src="https://public.flourish.studio/resources/made_with_flourish.svg" alt="Made with Flourish" /> </a></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 44  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8150b6" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8150b6">Is the RDA Sustainable?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz111"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
