                <!-- pageid: 45  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8151b0" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8151b0">Does the RDA Take Money Away From Schools?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz105"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '105';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '105';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('1.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8151b0" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">No. This is a critical misconception that must be corrected:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Schools keep 100% of the tax dollars they were already getting before the RDA began.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Only </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">75% of</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> new growth dollars are temporarily reinvested.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Alpine School District voluntarily participates in Vineyard&rsquo;s RDA through a formal Taxing Entity Committee.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">At the end of the RDA term, schools will permanently receive much more revenue due to increased property values.</span></li>
</ul>
<strong>Example:</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Alpine School District has already received substantial new funds from developments like the movie theater and Top Golf, none of which would exist without the RDA.<br /><br />This chart shows the school&rsquo;s 25% share of incremental tax dollars on top of the base tax revenues from the original undeveloped land values. The revenue for schools has grown significantly thanks to development.<br /></span> <iframe src="https://flo.uri.sh/visualisation/24541614/embed" title="Interactive or visual content" frameborder="0" class="flourish-embed-iframe" style="width: 100%; height: 600px;" scrolling="no" sandbox="allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-scripts allow-downloads allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation"></iframe>
<div style="width: 100%!; margin-top: 4px!important; text-align: right!important;"><a class="flourish-credit" style="text-decoration: none!important;" href="https://public.flourish.studio/visualisation/24541614/?utm_source=embed&amp;utm_campaign=visualisation/24541614" target="_top"><img style="width: 105px!important; height: 16px!important; border: none!important; margin: 0!important;" src="https://public.flourish.studio/resources/made_with_flourish.svg" alt="Made with Flourish" /> </a></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
                
                <!-- pageid: 45  -->
                
                <div class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-question">
                    <a class="faq-question-header" href="https://www.vineyardutah.gov/government/redevelopment_agency/faqs.php#collapse8151b1" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapse8151b1">How Does This Help Students?</a>
                    <div class="faq-editbtns">
                      <a name="revizefaq_rz108"></a>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq'; RZ.linkname = '';
						  RZ.template = '*none*'; RZ.recordid = '108';
						  RZ.nexturl = "editforms/revizefaq-editform.jsp";
						  RZ.popupwidth = ''; RZ.popupheight = ''; RZ.popupscroll = '';
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i><span class="sr-only">Edit</span></span>';
						  RZ.set = '';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('edititem');
                      </script>
                      <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
						  RZ.module = 'revizefaq';
						  RZ.recordid = '108';
						  RZ.name = 'RZdelete' + RZ.recordid;
						  RZ.img = '<span class="rzFaqBtn"><i class="fa fa-trash"></i><span class="sr-only">Delete</span></span>';
						  RZ.options = '';
						  if (typeof RZaction != 'undefined') RZaction('delete');
                      </script>

                      <span class="seq-no"><script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript">
if (typeof RZlogin != 'undefined') RZlogin('2.00', 'revizefaq', 'u');</script>
</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div id="collapse8151b1" class="faq-answer collapse">
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Students benefit in multiple ways:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Increased future tax base = more long-term funding for education</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Access to higher education and research through UVU and Huntsman Institute</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Safer neighborhoods, more housing, and community amenities</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Expansion of services and quality of life that help families thrive</span></li>
</ul>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
    			
